repra&#x0364;&#x017F;entirte, &#x017F;ie &#x017F;prach das Urtheil <note place="foot" n="10)">Arrian <hi rendition="#aq">Anab. Alex. 1. III. p. 72. C. ed. Steph.</hi></note>. Daß die Pa-<lb/>
